{
"file": 856,
"paths": [
"d008/d080/f018"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "fbd2bf93",
"en_raw": "This is Naruzawa Housing Complex...?"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "ae73313f",
"en_raw": "I'm not doing anything, really..."
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "56e5ef00",
"en_raw": "It seems to be chained up..."
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "8e4be3c4",
"en_raw": "Is it a pet dog..."
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "52d9aabe",
"en_raw": "Welcome to our republic"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "67c7852b",
"en_raw": "Ah, um, excuse me"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "a8c0c8cd",
"en_raw": "did two girls come"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "e7b8799b",
"en_raw": "this way?"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "d299690c",
"en_raw": "No, you're our only guest today"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "6fa310f2",
"en_raw": "Um, then, are you"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "2548370a",
"en_raw": "someone who lives here?"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "3ec59d2d",
"en_raw": "What, you want to live here?"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "d82635ef",
"en_raw": "...N-no, it's not that"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "a6f75e40",
"en_raw": "Heh heh, it's nice here"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "bae17480",
"en_raw": "It can't be called Japan"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "7c27ff63",
"en_raw": "There's freedom found nowhere else"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "88b851ef",
"en_raw": "Generally, Japan's politics"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "c7f6c7cc",
"en_raw": "today is no good"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "5ed30ad5",
"en_raw": "They take the people lightly"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "129456f6",
"en_raw": "Do they think we know"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "ba5db5aa",
"en_raw": "nothing?"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "dcbb8dbc",
"en_raw": "...Oops, I seem to have"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "371069c8",
"en_raw": "digressed a little"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "5cd30162",
"en_raw": "But if you want to move in"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "cd82fba6",
"en_raw": "today is just right"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "67d0e3c4",
"en_raw": "Well, no need to worry"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "84b9400b",
"en_raw": "deposit and rent"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "f7b5b6bf",
"en_raw": "can be exchanged for"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "f12cba5d",
"en_raw": "whatever you have"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "37698abe",
"en_raw": "I-I"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "c5fbbdf4",
"en_raw": "don't have anything..."
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "d6f17759",
"en_raw": "Well, I should start"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "ffbd8562",
"en_raw": "prepping dinner..."
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "b182b24c",
"en_raw": "...Now, shall we go?"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "0e87675e",
"en_raw": "Excuse me"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "071f35e3",
"en_raw": "I..."
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "85a283c0",
"en_raw": "Now, wait a moment"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "4eb7f4aa",
"en_raw": "Heh heh,"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "17414a47",
"en_raw": "where do you think you're going?"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "34cf0292",
"en_raw": "........"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "475b43c0",
"en_raw": "Well, have you made up your mind?"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "ec612222",
"en_raw": "N-no, not yet, a bit..."
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "05ff87d4",
"en_raw": "...N-not yet, you say?"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "302a8102",
"en_raw": "I, um..."
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "42e3bc2f",
"en_raw": "don't plan to live here..."
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "3656bef3",
"en_raw": "H-help me..."
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "580fbfc9",
"en_raw": "T-the Reaper again..."
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "43dc66a0",
"en_raw": "A-are you okay?"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "155c4fc8",
"en_raw": "You'll live here the rest of your life..."
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "50721f28",
"en_raw": "B-but I"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "d951967a",
"en_raw": "only came for my friends..."
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "81521e9a",
"en_raw": "I see, those two"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "a8df4e9b",
"en_raw": "They were soft and tasty"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "3320b479",
"en_raw": "Human flesh, for the first time in ages!!"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "76b67ede",
"en_raw": "No way..."
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "836dcf50",
"en_raw": "What's wrong, comrade?"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "4e1bc164",
"en_raw": "T-that's outrageous"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "c3cf47d7",
"en_raw": "Don't tease me"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "380eeaa9",
"en_raw": "I have to go home"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "dcee5faf",
"en_raw": "I see, but..."
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "1dedcbbc",
"en_raw": "You can't go home anymore"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "ff11d643",
"en_raw": "You betrayed us"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "bb9d2712",
"en_raw": "You'll die here!"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "0357ef1d",
"en_raw": "Melos!"
}
]
}